+
+  p4 [label="Phase 4: Doc Quality\nPer doc change:\n• mj-agent-doc-validate\n• INDEX.md synced?\n• updated field current?\n• AGENTS/既有指南主题归属 synced (§6.4.1)?" shape=box];
+
