+## 本技能的执行约定
+
+执行前读取 [共用执行边界](../../references/execution-boundaries.md)。独立调用只完成本技能；委派时记录调用者与返回阶段，同阶段必要校验完成后返回。下游 Handoff 均为建议，不能自动跨阶段或发布。受保护动作先完成可审阅草案；Owner 批准与宿主执行能力分开，hook 硬阻断时返回 `BLOCKED_EXECUTION_ROUTE`。
+
+
+## 触发与职责详述
+
+This skill orchestrates the ordered START of the mj-agent local-dev app runtime as one motion — a prerequisite gate via the default `mj-agent check` (delegates to mj-agent-infra-env-setup when creds / .env / uv sync are missing), an already-running short-circuit, storage/stack bring-up before the live gate (delegates to mj-agent-infra-docker-compose), a default-run-but-skippable `mj-agent check --live` gate (async memory #283 + biz DB SELECT 1 + one-token LLM round-trip), HITL runtime selection (default = container compose stack; else LangGraph Studio `langgraph dev` / Chainlit `mj-agent serve`), a launch-mode choice for foreground servers (you run it in your terminal / Codex runs it in the background), the launch, and `curl --noproxy '*'` root-URL health verification. Make sure to use this skill whenever the user says "启动 mj-agent", "把 app 跑起来", "start the app", "launch the agent", "起本地开发环境", "run mj-agent locally", "serve the UI", "拉起本地服务栈". Do not use for: secret/.env bootstrap + uv sync + offline check (use mj-agent-infra-env-setup); the low-level compose up/ps/logs/down primitive (use mj-agent-infra-docker-compose); the interactive Studio data-boundary walkthrough H1/H2/H3/R1/R2 (use mj-agent-infra-studio-probe); DGX endpoint probing (use mj-agent-infra-llm-endpoint-probe); stopping the running app (use mj-agent-infra-app-stop); destructive docker cleanup / volume+image wipe (use mj-agent-infra-env-teardown).
+
+
+## Overview
+
+Ordered **START** orchestrator for the mj-agent local-dev app runtime — the reversible
+counterpart to `mj-agent-infra-app-stop`. **Stage 10 sub** of the 17-stage 执行闭环（本地拉起
+runtime 做验证 / 演示）；也可作为纯 dev 起服的独立入口。
+
+**infra 家族分工**：原 6 个 infra skill 供给/销毁 **capacity**（secrets / containers / storage /
+endpoints——名词）；本 skill（+ `app-stop`）操作 **runtime**（launch / stop 进程——动词）。本
+skill **不重新实现** 下游能力，而是把它们缝成一条有序启动路径：
+
+```text
+[env-setup 已就绪] -> THIS-SKILL -> {container stack up-d | langgraph dev | mj-agent serve}
+                       ├─ (缺 creds) -> mj-agent-infra-env-setup
+                       ├─ (DGX provider) -> mj-agent-infra-llm-endpoint-probe
+                       ├─ (storage) -> mj-agent-infra-docker-compose
+                       └─ verify -> mj-agent-infra-studio-probe | mj-agent-infra-app-stop
+```
+
+> **Native origin（非 mj-system 镜像）**：mj-system 的 `ops-*` 家族在 mj-agent 被 ADR-016
+> §Decision 1 有意去掉；本 skill 只借鉴"需要一个统一起服动作"这一问题识别，方案（步骤 / HITL
+> 粒度 / 端口 / 命令）全按 mj-agent 自身栈 native 设计，归入既有 `infra` 家族（名字匹配
+> 原生 schema/命名按共用说明检查；冻结契约变更需另行批准）。
+
+**Reference**:
+- `repo:src/mj_agent/server/cli.py`（`serve` / `check [--live]` 实现；`serve` 用
+  `subprocess.call` spawn 一个 chainlit **子进程**——`app-stop` 的 tree-kill 依据）
+- `repo:decisions/ADR-027_LLM_Provider_Abstraction.md`（`ark` vs `local-openai-compat`；DGX 前置）
