+- **Track C 工程编排侧**（`.agents/skills/mj-agent-*/SKILL.md` / `.codex/hooks.json`
+  / 执行闭环 等）—— [[sdd/workflows/execution-loop|执行闭环 workflow]]
+  + [[policies/development-skills|development skills policy]] §Scope / §Standards
