-```yaml
-hitl_required:
-  - sql-guardrail-relax              # 不复制 trigger 描述
-  - prompt-version-bump              # canonical 描述在 sdd/gates.md §4
-  - biz-catalog-sync                 # M3 contract test 按 ID lookup
-  - runtime-skill-content-change     # drift 收敛到单点
