-from src.mj_agent.skills import load_skill
-body = load_skill("safe-sql-analysis")  # frontmatter 已 strip
-
-# 错误（违反契约）：
-body = open("src/mj_agent/skills/safe-sql-analysis/SKILL.md").read()  # 含 frontmatter
-```
